{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021080/extras/2b6fa730b0e870bb71bc5f22fedbe8f4.poster.avif?t=1771760129\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021080/extras/2b6fa730b0e870bb71bc5f22fedbe8f4.webm?t=1771760129\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021080/extras/2b6fa730b0e870bb71bc5f22fedbe8f4.mp4?t=1771760129\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Decorate an Undersea World, Meet New Friends, and Unravel the Ocean\u2019s Mystery</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Luminote Mio: Aqualoom at Ocean\u2019s End is a cozy aquascape simulation where you play as <strong>Mio</strong>, a playful girl bound to the sea. Design aquascapes, befriend customers, and uncover the truth behind the disappearance phenomenon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Creativity for Victory</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arrange aquascapes freely with corals, plants, and decorations to bring your ocean world to life.\u00a0Design soothing underwater spaces with vibrant decor, glowing flora, and your own creative touch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Immersive Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow Mio\u2019s heartfelt journey of loss, discovery, and her deep connection with the sea.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gain and Unlocks</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fulfill wishes, get paid, and unlocks more decorations and customization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Meet New Friends</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have a chat with quirky characters, unravel their stories, and build bonds that shape your adventure.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4021080?t=1771760129","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021080/8504b6228c682e1ceb4c5c6bbf918e5683245200/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771760129","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021080/d87f9ad3b0df8743464b15bc464861584041149f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771760129","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021080/d87f9ad3b0df8743464b15bc464861584041149f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771760129","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021080/extras/2b6fa730b0e870bb71bc5f22fedbe8f4.poster.avif?t=1771760129\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021080/extras/2b6fa730b0e870bb71bc5f22fedbe8f4.webm?t=1771760129\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021080/extras/2b6fa730b0e870bb71bc5f22fedbe8f4.mp4?t=1771760129\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Decorate an Undersea World, Meet New Friends, and Unravel the Ocean\u2019s Mystery</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Luminote Mio: Aqualoom at Ocean\u2019s End is a cozy aquascape simulation where you play as <strong>Mio</strong>, a playful girl bound to the sea. Design aquascapes, befriend customers, and uncover the truth behind the disappearance phenomenon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Creativity for Victory</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arrange aquascapes freely with corals, plants, and decorations to bring your ocean world to life.\u00a0Design soothing underwater spaces with vibrant decor, glowing flora, and your own creative touch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Immersive Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow Mio\u2019s heartfelt journey of loss, discovery, and her deep connection with the sea.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gain and Unlocks</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fulfill wishes, get paid, and unlocks more decorations and customization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Meet New Friends</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have a chat with quirky characters, unravel their stories, and build bonds that shape your adventure.</p>","developers":["LOGIC - Thizen Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021080/675d7d5ab357ccbaa8c0f053ce289cec960f369b/header.jpg?t=1771760129","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4021080/1932440810/10b5c16312a31b51c5a31c80f313adf59c3dc0a9/1771759112/dash_av1.mpd?t=1771760127","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4021080/1932440810/10b5c16312a31b51c5a31c80f313adf59c3dc0a9/1771759112/dash_h264.mpd?t=1771760127","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4021080/1932440810/10b5c16312a31b51c5a31c80f313adf59c3dc0a9/1771759112/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1771760127","id":257292115,"name":"Early Trailer Luminote Mio: Aqualoo